# Insp3ct0r

## Objective
Inspect the source code of a web page and find the hidden flag.

## Solution

- Opened the website.
- Used Developer Tools (`F12`).
- Inspected the HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files.
- Combined the three parts of the flag.

## What I Learned

- How to use browser Developer Tools.
- How to inspect HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files.
- Sensitive information should never be left inside client-side code.
